==== Opening the case ====

The top case simply clips in with 2 clips per side (so 8 clips in total). Insert several thin sturdy devices (e.g. knives) to lift the clips away from the case until you can remove the top cover.

The device consists of 2 PCBs. The top and bottom PCBs are simply held in place and connected by 2x12 pins. Gently pull on the top PCB to remove it from the bottom PCB.

